{
  "bookId": "hero-211103",
  "id": "bond-29337",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29337001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "岛主，我回来了哦~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊，怎么带了一大堆花回来？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "呵呵，说来话长，今天早上我出门的时候遇到了一只「黑猫先生」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "然后……「黑猫先生」朝我扑了过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "原来「黑猫先生」的目标是我身后的蝴蝶，身上还飘下来一张写着地址的订货单。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "我按着地址找了过去……居然来到了一家花店。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "喔，这些花是这么来的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嗯嗯，是长着狐狸耳朵的店长答谢我的哦，之前他还有点苦恼订货单丢了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "似乎知道是哪家花店了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "他还给了我一张抽奖券，说是最好和岛主一起刮开来看看呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好，我试试……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "一等奖……一年份的每日鲜花配送服务！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "欸——太好了呢，岛主！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29337016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嘿嘿，这下子每天都能够赏花了呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
